  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rise and Shine Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve its organization and financial management capacity and well as increase production by constructing an office and storage warehouse; providing production tools and equipment; a working capital fund; and training to improve organizational and management operations.</narrative>
